The generated files config/schema.json and config/provider-metadata.yaml, and
the field descriptions in apis/, examples-generated/ and package/crds/, carry
text taken from the terraform-provider-talos v0.12.0 schema and documentation,
which is MPL-2.0; its source is the tag listed above.

Terraform itself is not included. Terraform 1.5.7 (MPL-2.0) is used only at
development time, to dump the provider schema into config/schema.json.
